{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "8f3a1c2e-4d9b-4a10-9c7e-5b1d2e3f4a56",
    "name": "Dowith.id - Subscription Reminder (DEV)",
    "description": "Endpoint DEV untuk menguji fitur subscription reminder & read-only secara manual. Semua endpoint /dev/* otomatis mati di production (NODE_ENV=production).\n\nCARA PAKAI:\n1. Login ambil JWT (lihat request 'Login / Ambil Token'), isi variable `token`.\n2. Jalankan 'Set Plan' / 'Set Trial' sesuai skenario yang mau diuji.\n3. Jalankan 'Trigger Reminder' untuk mengeksekusi cron secara manual (tanpa nunggu tiap jam).\n4. Cek hasil di kolom 'Notification'.\n\nCATATAN JAM 13:00:\n- Reminder upgrade PRO/PLATINUM hanya terkirim jika `subscriptionEndsAt` JATUH HARI INI dan jam sudah >= 13:00 (waktu lokal server).\n- Jika jam server < 13:00 tapi mau langsung cek, set `subscriptionEndsAt` dengan `days: 0` (hari ini) lalu trigger saat jam >= 13:00.\n\nREAD-ONLY: setelah `subscriptionEndsAt <= now`, semua request mutasi (POST/PUT/DELETE) ditolak 403; GET tetap 200.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Auth - Login Google / Ambil Token",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login lewat Google (redirect)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/google",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "google"]
            },
            "description": "Buka di browser -> nanti redirect balik dengan token. Set variable `token` dari hasil login (di localStorage/cookie aplikasi)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cek Profil (validasi token & plan)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["users", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Response berisi `plan`, `trial` dan `subscription` (subscriptionEndsAt, daysLeft, subscriptionExpired, isReadOnly). Gunakan ini untuk verifikasi state sebelum/sesudah set."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Set State User (PRO / PLATINUM)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "PRO - expired (READ-ONLY) [days:-1]",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"plan\": \"PRO\",\n  \"days\": -1\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/dev/subscription",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["dev", "subscription"]
            },
            "description": "subscriptionEndsAt = KEMARIN. User sudah expired -> READ-ONLY. Setelah trigger, tidak ada reminder (sudah lewat); tapi READ-ONLY aktif (mutasi 403)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PRO - hari ini habis (reminder jam 13) [days:0]",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"plan\": \"PRO\",\n  \"days\": 0\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/dev/subscription",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["dev", "subscription"]
            },
            "description": "subscriptionEndsAt = SEKARANG (hari ini). Jika jam server >= 13:00, trigger akan mengirim reminder 'Langganan Habis Hari Ini!' + READ-ONLY aktif."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PRO - besok habis [days:1]",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"plan\": \"PRO\",\n  \"days\": 1\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/dev/subscription",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["dev", "subscription"]
            },
            "description": "subscriptionEndsAt = BESOK. Belum hari terakhir, jadi belum ada reminder hari ini (tidak trigger). Berguna cek bahwa tidak ada notif prematur."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PLATINUM - hari ini habis [days:0]",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"plan\": \"PLATINUM\",\n  \"days\": 0\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/dev/subscription",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["dev", "subscription"]
            },
            "description": "Sama seperti PRO days:0 tapi untuk PLATINUM (mengecek teks dinamis 'Platinum')."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reset - PRO tanpa subscription [no days]",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"plan\": \"PRO\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/dev/subscription",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["dev", "subscription"]
            },
            "description": "PRO tanpa subscriptionEndsAt (null). Digunakan untuk reset sebelum test ulang."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Set State User (FREE Trial)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "FREE - trial habis besok (H-1) [days:1]",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"days\": 1\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/dev/trial",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["dev", "trial"]
            },
            "description": "plan=FREE, trialEndsAt=BESOK. Trigger akan mengirim notif trial H-1 'Akses Trial Habis Besok!'."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "FREE - trial habis hari ini [days:0]",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"days\": 0\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/dev/trial",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["dev", "trial"]
            },
            "description": "plan=FREE, trialEndsAt=SEKARANG. Trial habis -> READ-ONLY (mutasi 403). Tidak ada reminder (bukan H-1 lagi)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "FREE - trial sudah habis [days:-1]",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"days\": -1\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/dev/trial",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["dev", "trial"]
            },
            "description": "plan=FREE, trialEndsAt=KEMARIN. Trial habis -> READ-ONLY penuh."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Trigger Cron (manual)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Trigger Reminder Sekarang",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/dev/trigger-subscription-reminder",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["dev", "trigger-subscription-reminder"]
            },
            "description": "Menjalankan cron secara manual (tanpa menunggu tiap jam). Response berisi `result.processed`. Jalankan berkali-kali untuk cek idempotensi: panggilan kedua tidak mengirim notif ganda."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Verifikasi Notifikasi & READ-ONLY",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Cek Notifikasi In-App",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/notifications",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["notifications"]
            },
            "description": "Cek notif terbaru (title 'Langganan Habis Hari Ini!', 'Akses Trial Habis Besok!', dll)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Uji READ-ONLY - POST transaksi (harus 403)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"amount\": 10000,\n  \"description\": \"Test read-only\",\n  \"type\": \"EXPENSE\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/transactions",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["transactions"]
            },
            "description": "Jika user READ-ONLY -> harapkan 403 'Akses ditolak: Langganan Anda telah kedaluwarsa...'"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Uji READ-ONLY - GET transaksi (harus 200)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/transactions",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["transactions"]
            },
            "description": "Harus tetap 200 (baca data tetap diizinkan dalam mode READ-ONLY)."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
